@Karm I decided to simplify things a bit more because the code was a bit hard to follow: https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/32309 .

@chberger could you try to build this PR https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/32309 locally? You can do it with `./mvnw -Dquickly`. Once done, just execute `./mvnw clean install -f integration-tests/hibernate-validator -Dquarkus.native.container-build=true -Dnative` and see if things work for you.
I would like to make sure we didn't break anything before backporting this series of PRs.
